# Claude Code's own workspace. `launch.json` is the dev-server config for its
# browser preview and `scheduled_tasks.lock` is tool state — useful locally,
# not part of the project. `.github/workflows/` is deliberately NOT here: that
# is the CI pipeline and it has to stay tracked.
